      <ns0:trans-unit id="e6703f9e5145eca036d9965e6430f49b">
        <ns0:source>The module detects the PHP and PrestaShop version at runtime and automatically selects the matching translation system, hooks and product page handling. The PHP version you can use is limited by your PrestaShop version.</ns0:source>
